  "prefLabel": "Hum 312.01 Joinder",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hum 312.01 Joinder. Whenever it shall appear that 2 or more complaints involve substantially similar or substantially related issues, the hearing commissioners shall join those proceedings for hearing, for decision or both.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hum 300) #8815-A, eff 2-3-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hum100-300.html"
